-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on DINOv3
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

PointDiT conditions on a frozen DINOv3 encoder. No DINOv3 code or weights are
vendored in this directory: the encoder is loaded from a user-supplied local
checkout of https://github.com/facebookresearch/dinov3, and its LVD-1689M
weights are access-gated by Meta and must be obtained separately under the
DINOv3 License Agreement. See README.md for setup.
